00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:57.280
Once you have been approved for the

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:58.640
program and have agreed to the program

00:03:57.280 --> 00:04:00.520
terms, you'll go through an onboarding

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:02.240
process where you learn how the program

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:04.520
works, how deliveries are handled. It

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:06.880
really is that simple. Personally, if I

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:09.120
had a coffee shop, gym, a local

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:10.560
